## PII

The pii metric uses Presidio to detect personally identifiable information in your data. You can enable it by adding the following metrics 
to your yaml policy.

```yaml
<!-- DOCSUB_INSERT metric_library_pii -->
```

This will automatically include all pii metrics.

```python
